  "question": {
    "text": "A satellite is moving with a constant speed <math><mi>v</mi></math> in circular orbit around the earth. An object of mass &#39;<em>m</em>&#39; is ejected from the satellite such that it just escapes from the gravitational pull of the earth. At the time of ejection, the kinetic energy of the object is:"
